// 32x32 grayscale image, restart_marker_blocks=2 (DRI restart_interval
// = 2 MCUs), quality 90. Each 8x8-aligned block holds a distinct solid
// value (block_value(x, y) = (50 + 10*((x/8)+(y/8)*4)) % 256), so as
// with clipped_gray_jpeg the decode is DC-only and exact regardless of
// quality; a from-scratch PIL reopen matched every one of the 1024
// pixels exactly. This fixture carries a DRI segment and 7 RSTn
